      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#C8A363>03 / CAST YOUR MAGIC</color>

    Hold and drag an aimed Active or Ultimate, then release to cast. Drag farther to place a ground skill farther away. Tap without dragging to target the nearest visible enemy in range; with no target, use your last aim or facing direction. Drag onto X and release to cancel without spending cooldown. Shadow dashes where you drag. Area and screen-wide skills remain tap buttons. Daphne can also switch Solar and Lunar stance.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
